## 45. Development Architecture

During early development, Aurora should not immediately attempt to produce a complete installable operating system.

Instead, development should proceed in layers.

```
Phase 1
Aurora AI API prototype
        ↓
Phase 2
Aurora AI daemon
        ↓
Phase 3
IPC integration
        ↓
Phase 4
Linux service integration
        ↓
Phase 5
Desktop integration
        ↓
Phase 6
Bootable Aurora environment
        ↓
Phase 7
Installer / distribution

```

This allows architectural assumptions to be tested before the project becomes difficult to change.

