## 59. Architectural Goal

Aurora should ultimately demonstrate that an operating system can treat AI as a **first-class system capability without turning the AI into a privileged, monolithic component**.

The target architecture is therefore not:

> "Linux with an AI chatbot installed."

It is:

> **Linux providing the foundation, Aurora providing an integrated system-services layer, and AI functioning as a controlled platform capability available throughout the operating system.**

The architecture should remain understandable, testable, replaceable, and secure as Aurora grows.

